From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Virtroid build <build@virtroid.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:24:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build without GrapheneOS's MTE product variable

device_has_arm_mte exists only in GrapheneOS's build system, and Soong refuses a property it doesn't know. Memory tagging is an Arm feature, and this image is x86_64 only.
---
 Android.bp | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 1cb24ee..59b1004 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -72,9 +72,6 @@ cc_library {
         debuggable: {
             cflags: ["-DCONFIG_LABEL_MEMORY=true"],
         },
-        device_has_arm_mte: {
-            cflags: ["-DHAS_ARM_MTE", "-march=armv8-a+dotprod+memtag"]
-        },
     },
     apex_available: [
         "com.android.runtime",
